{"id":"vol9-06","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-06/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":366.02,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":4.46,"text":"Part 2 You will hear the manager of the Linwood","words":[["Part",0.0,0.38],["2",0.38,0.88],["You",0.88,2.48],["will",2.48,2.68],["hear",2.68,2.9],["the",2.9,3.08],["manager",3.08,3.46],["of",3.46,3.96],["the",3.96,4.12],["Linwood",4.12,4.46]]},{"start":4.46,"end":9.34,"text":"Apartment Complex introducing the complex to a group of new residents.","words":[["Apartment",4.46,4.96],["Complex",4.96,5.66],["introducing",5.66,6.36],["the",6.36,6.92],["complex",6.92,7.3],["to",7.3,7.94],["a",7.94,8.1],["group",8.1,8.26],["of",8.26,8.5],["new",8.5,8.7],["residents.",8.7,9.34]]},{"start":10.32,"end":15.0,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 14.","words":[["First,",10.32,11.04],["you",11.52,11.7],["have",11.7,11.88],["some",11.88,12.06],["time",12.06,12.42],["to",12.42,12.64],["look",12.64,12.76],["at",12.76,12.92],["questions",12.92,13.26],["11",13.26,14.02],["to",14.02,14.5],["14.",14.5,15.0]]},{"start":45.65,"end":50.01,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.","words":[["Now",45.65,46.15],["listen",46.15,46.43],["carefully",46.43,46.91],["and",46.91,47.47],["answer",47.47,47.75],["questions",47.75,48.21],["11",48.21,49.01],["to",49.01,49.49],["14.",49.49,50.01]]},{"start":53.47,"end":56.57,"text":"Good afternoon everyone and thank you for coming to the meeting.","words":[["Good",53.47,54.13],["afternoon",54.13,54.53],["everyone",54.53,54.95],["and",54.95,55.57],["thank",55.57,55.73],["you",55.73,55.81],["for",55.81,55.93],["coming",55.93,56.09],["to",56.09,56.25],["the",56.25,56.35],["meeting.",56.35,56.57]]},{"start":57.27,"end":61.09,"text":"My name is Bob McDonald and I'm the manager of the Linwood Apartment Complex.","words":[["My",57.27,57.57],["name",57.57,57.77],["is",57.77,57.91],["Bob",57.91,58.15],["McDonald",58.15,58.51],["and",58.51,58.95],["I'm",58.95,59.25],["the",59.25,59.33],["manager",59.33,59.63],["of",59.63,59.87],["the",59.87,59.97],["Linwood",59.97,60.21],["Apartment",60.21,60.61],["Complex.",60.61,61.09]]},{"start":61.83,"end":65.67,"text":"Firstly, I'd like to welcome you all. I'm sure you'll enjoy living here.","words":[["Firstly,",61.83,62.35],["I'd",62.55,62.81],["like",62.81,62.89],["to",62.89,63.03],["welcome",63.03,63.25],["you",63.25,63.45],["all.",63.45,63.67],["I'm",64.07,64.21],["sure",64.21,64.47],["you'll",64.47,64.75],["enjoy",64.75,64.99],["living",64.99,65.35],["here.",65.35,65.67]]},{"start":66.71,"end":69.41,"text":"Let's start with a little bit of history about the Linwood apartments.","words":[["Let's",66.71,67.23],["start",67.23,67.41],["with",67.41,67.57],["a",67.57,67.65],["little",67.65,67.77],["bit",67.77,67.93],["of",67.93,68.05],["history",68.05,68.33],["about",68.33,68.63],["the",68.63,68.79],["Linwood",68.79,69.01],["apartments.",69.01,69.41]]},{"start":70.21,"end":73.81,"text":"The council first discussed the concept of this project five years ago.","words":[["The",70.21,70.39],["council",70.39,70.63],["first",70.63,71.03],["discussed",71.03,71.49],["the",71.49,71.69],["concept",71.69,72.09],["of",72.09,72.25],["this",72.25,72.41],["project",72.41,72.79],["five",72.79,73.15],["years",73.15,73.51],["ago.",73.51,73.81]]},{"start":74.31,"end":77.95,"text":"There was a small delay initially while plans and administration were completed.","words":[["There",74.31,74.51],["was",74.51,74.69],["a",74.69,74.81],["small",74.81,75.01],["delay",75.01,75.45],["initially",75.45,75.73],["while",75.73,76.03],["plans",76.03,76.49],["and",76.49,76.69],["administration",76.69,77.13],["were",77.13,77.53],["completed.",77.53,77.95]]},{"start":78.79,"end":80.63,"text":"Work finally started three years later.","words":[["Work",78.79,79.03],["finally",79.03,79.39],["started",79.39,79.71],["three",79.71,79.99],["years",79.99,80.27],["later.",80.27,80.63]]},{"start":81.11,"end":84.47,"text":"One year ago, the complex was finished and received its first residence.","words":[["One",81.11,81.35],["year",81.35,81.59],["ago,",81.59,81.87],["the",81.97,82.07],["complex",82.07,82.31],["was",82.31,82.61],["finished",82.61,82.89],["and",82.89,83.31],["received",83.31,83.63],["its",83.63,83.83],["first",83.83,84.03],["residence.",84.03,84.47]]},{"start":84.93,"end":87.65,"text":"And I'm happy to say it's been a great place to live ever since.","words":[["And",84.93,85.15],["I'm",85.15,85.29],["happy",85.29,85.49],["to",85.49,85.65],["say",85.65,85.85],["it's",85.85,86.11],["been",86.11,86.25],["a",86.25,86.35],["great",86.35,86.57],["place",86.57,86.83],["to",86.83,87.03],["live",87.03,87.13],["ever",87.13,87.39],["since.",87.39,87.65]]},{"start":88.65,"end":91.59,"text":"So now just a little bit more about my role within the complex.","words":[["So",88.65,89.13],["now",89.13,89.35],["just",89.35,89.59],["a",89.59,89.77],["little",89.77,89.87],["bit",89.87,90.01],["more",90.01,90.21],["about",90.21,90.45],["my",90.45,90.61],["role",90.61,90.87],["within",90.87,91.15],["the",91.15,91.25],["complex.",91.25,91.59]]},{"start":92.45,"end":99.03,"text":"I'm responsible for ensuring that rent is paid on time, but I can't say I get a lot of satisfaction from that aspect of the job.","words":[["I'm",92.45,92.93],["responsible",92.93,93.27],["for",93.27,93.67],["ensuring",93.67,94.11],["that",94.11,94.35],["rent",94.35,94.59],["is",94.59,94.75],["paid",94.75,95.01],["on",95.01,95.21],["time,",95.21,95.55],["but",95.67,95.73],["I",95.73,95.89],["can't",95.89,96.33],["say",96.33,96.47],["I",96.47,96.65],["get",96.65,96.79],["a",96.79,96.93],["lot",96.93,97.03],["of",97.03,97.11],["satisfaction",97.11,97.57],["from",97.57,97.91],["that",97.91,98.07],["aspect",98.07,98.43],["of",98.43,98.59],["the",98.59,98.67],["job.",98.67,99.03]]},{"start":100.25,"end":105.71,"text":"Fortunately, because the building is quite new, there is generally little to do to keep everything in good working order.","words":[["Fortunately,",100.25,100.73],["because",101.05,101.31],["the",101.31,101.53],["building",101.53,101.71],["is",101.71,101.91],["quite",101.91,102.13],["new,",102.13,102.39],["there",102.61,102.71],["is",102.71,102.85],["generally",102.85,103.13],["little",103.13,103.59],["to",103.59,103.85],["do",103.85,104.03],["to",104.03,104.23],["keep",104.23,104.39],["everything",104.39,104.73],["in",104.73,104.95],["good",104.95,105.11],["working",105.11,105.41],["order.",105.41,105.71]]},{"start":106.29,"end":113.37,"text":"What I love is working with the people who live here, especially helping neighbours deal with any little misunderstandings that might come up between them.","words":[["What",106.29,106.49],["I",106.49,106.69],["love",106.69,107.03],["is",107.03,107.27],["working",107.27,107.57],["with",107.57,107.79],["the",107.79,107.89],["people",107.89,108.13],["who",108.13,108.33],["live",108.33,108.57],["here,",108.57,108.89],["especially",109.03,109.33],["helping",109.33,109.67],["neighbours",109.67,110.03],["deal",110.03,110.37],["with",110.37,110.57],["any",110.57,110.77],["little",110.77,111.07],["misunderstandings",111.07,112.05],["that",112.05,112.21],["might",112.21,112.41],["come",112.41,112.67],["up",112.67,112.83],["between",112.83,113.13],["them.",113.13,113.37]]},{"start":114.67,"end":118.61,"text":"We want you to feel at home here, but there are some restrictions on what you can do.","words":[["We",114.67,115.15],["want",115.15,115.37],["you",115.37,115.47],["to",115.47,115.55],["feel",115.55,115.71],["at",115.71,115.87],["home",115.87,116.17],["here,",116.17,116.43],["but",116.49,116.67],["there",116.67,116.81],["are",116.81,116.95],["some",116.95,117.19],["restrictions",117.19,117.59],["on",117.59,117.93],["what",117.93,118.07],["you",118.07,118.19],["can",118.19,118.35],["do.",118.35,118.61]]},{"start":119.21,"end":123.87,"text":"You're welcome to redecorate inside your apartment if you don't like the colour, but you can't","words":[["You're",119.21,119.69],["welcome",119.69,119.97],["to",119.97,120.17],["redecorate",120.17,120.77],["inside",120.77,121.05],["your",121.05,121.33],["apartment",121.33,121.73],["if",121.73,121.93],["you",121.93,122.01],["don't",122.01,122.17],["like",122.17,122.35],["the",122.35,122.45],["colour,",122.45,122.79],["but",123.11,123.29],["you",123.29,123.43],["can't",123.43,123.87]]},{"start":123.87,"end":128.07,"text":"change the outward appearance of the building in any way, and that also includes altering","words":[["change",123.87,124.09],["the",124.09,124.31],["outward",124.31,124.67],["appearance",124.67,125.03],["of",125.03,125.23],["the",125.23,125.31],["building",125.31,125.57],["in",125.57,125.75],["any",125.75,125.91],["way,",125.91,126.27],["and",126.63,126.83],["that",126.83,126.93],["also",126.93,127.13],["includes",127.13,127.59],["altering",127.59,128.07]]},{"start":128.07,"end":131.41,"text":"the plantings around the complex by putting in your own trees or flowers.","words":[["the",128.07,128.17],["plantings",128.17,128.69],["around",128.69,128.89],["the",128.89,129.07],["complex",129.07,129.37],["by",129.37,129.65],["putting",129.65,129.89],["in",129.89,130.07],["your",130.07,130.21],["own",130.21,130.45],["trees",130.45,130.83],["or",130.83,131.09],["flowers.",131.09,131.41]]},{"start":132.89,"end":135.77,"text":"Now some of you were asking earlier about the welcome party.","words":[["Now",132.89,133.37],["some",133.37,133.59],["of",133.59,133.71],["you",133.71,133.83],["were",133.83,134.01],["asking",134.01,134.25],["earlier",134.25,134.53],["about",134.53,134.85],["the",134.85,135.05],["welcome",135.05,135.31],["party.",135.31,135.77]]},{"start":136.13,"end":140.31,"text":"That will be held as planned next Friday evening, and we'll be doing all the catering","words":[["That",136.13,136.49],["will",136.49,136.59],["be",136.59,136.73],["held",136.73,136.97],["as",136.97,137.15],["planned",137.15,137.47],["next",137.47,137.81],["Friday",137.81,138.05],["evening,",138.05